{
  "id": "ISA.43",
  "number": "43",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 43",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "43",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 43"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "43",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now thus saith Jehovah that created thee, O Jacob, and he that formed thee, O Israel: Fear not, for I have redeemed thee; I have called thee by thy name, thou art mine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou passest through the waters, I will be with thee; and through the rivers, they shall not overflow thee: when thou walkest through the fire, thou shalt not be burned, neither shall the flame kindle upon thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am Jehovah thy God, the Holy One of Israel, thy Saviour; I have given Egypt as thy ransom, Ethiopia and Seba in thy stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Since thou hast been precious in my sight, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " honorable, and I have loved thee; therefore will I give men in thy stead, and peoples instead of thy life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear not; for I am with thee: I will bring thy seed from the east, and gather thee from the west; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will say to the north, Give up; and to the south, Keep not back; bring my sons from far, and my daughters from the end of the earth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "every one that is called by my name, and whom I have created for my glory, whom I have formed, yea, whom I have made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring forth the blind people that have eyes, and the deaf that have ears. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let all the nations be gathered together, and let the peoples be assembled: who among them can declare this, and show us former things? let them bring their witnesses, that they may be justified; or let them hear, and say, It is truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye are my witnesses, saith Jehovah, and my servant whom I have chosen; that ye may know and believe me, and understand that I am he: before me there was no God formed, neither shall there be after me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, even I, am Jehovah; and besides me there is no saviour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have declared, and I have saved, and I have showed; and there was no strange ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " among you: therefore ye are my witnesses, saith Jehovah, and I am God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, since the day was I am he; and there is none that can deliver out of my hand: I will work, and who can hinder it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith Jehovah, your Redeemer, the Holy One of Israel: For your sake I have sent to Babylon, and I will bring down all of them as fugitives, even the Chaldeans, in the ships of their rejoicing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am Jehovah, your Holy One, the Creator of Israel, your King. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith Jehovah, who maketh a way in the sea, and a path in the mighty waters; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who bringeth forth the chariot and horse, the army and the mighty man (they lie down together, they shall not rise; they are extinct, they are quenched as a wick): ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember ye not the former things, neither consider the things of old. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will do a new thing; now shall it spring forth; shall ye not know it? I will even make a way in the wilderness, and rivers in the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beasts of the field shall honor me, the jackals and the ostriches; because I give waters in the wilderness, and rivers in the desert, to give drink to my people, my chosen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people which I formed for myself, that they might set forth my praise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet thou hast not called upon me, O Jacob; but thou hast been weary of me, O Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast not brought me of thy sheep for burnt-offerings; neither hast thou honored me with thy sacrifices. I have not burdened thee with offerings, nor wearied thee with frankincense. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast bought me no sweet cane with money, neither hast thou filled me with the fat of thy sacrifices; but thou hast burdened me with thy sins, thou hast wearied me with thine iniquities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, even I, am he that blotteth out thy transgressions for mine own sake; and I will not remember thy sins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put me in remembrance; let us plead together: set thou forth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that thou mayest be justified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy first father sinned, and thy teachers have transgressed against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I will profane the princes of the sanctuary; and I will make Jacob a curse, and Israel a reviling.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
